<title>NEW ZEALAND: TABLE-NZ ADRs follow Dow lower at close.</title>
<headline>TABLE-NZ ADRs follow Dow lower at close.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>New Zealand ADRs ended softer while the Dow dropped 32.28 points to 8,222.61.</p>
<p>Price movements of NZ stocks listed in the U.S. and Australia.</p>
<p>Company	 Exchange    Last	  Net change</p>
<p>FCL Bldg	 N.Y.    US$28/07	  -0 1/2</p>
<p>FCL Engy	 N.Y.    US$34 1/4	 -0 1/8</p>
<p>FCL Paper	N.Y.    US$22 1/2	 -0 1/8</p>
<p>FCL Forest     N.Y.    US$13/05	  -</p>
<p>MAS Tech	 NASDAQ  US$20 1/4	 +0 3/8</p>
<p>Telecom	  N.Y.    US$40/07	  -0/07</p>
<p>Tranz Rail    N.Y.    US$17 1/4	 -0 5/8</p>
<p>Lion	    Sydney  A$3.46		+2</p>
<p>Goodman	 Sydney  A$2.06		-</p>
<p>Macraes	 Sydney  A$1.25		-5</p>
<p>Notes - In New York, Telecom's American Depository Receipts are traded in bundles of eight shares, while both the Fletcher Challenge shares are in bundles of 10 each. Tranz Rail ADSs are groups of three ordinary shares.</p>
<p>- London prices are mid-rates.</p>
<p>-- Wellington Newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
</text>
